                        <div id="page-title">
                            中国分部异常项目
                        </div>
                    

                    

                    



                    <div id="page-content">
                        

<p><strong>前言：</strong>SCP基金会中国分部发现了为数不少的项目无用而不值得进一步关注。本文件列出了那些激起了一些好奇心的项目。如果这些项目的知识在将来变得有用或必要，则可以将其作为一种资源。<br />
— █████博士，Site-CN-██研究主管</p>
<p>欲查看已归档的异常项目记录，请<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn-arc">点击这里</a>。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p style="text-align: center;"><a class="button create-button" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00470/parentPage/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/#_editpage">添加新的记录</a></p>
</div>
    
    
    
    </div>
<p style="text-align: center;">显示顺序：<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating%20desc">评分较高</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating">评分较低</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name">最早发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name%20desc">最新发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/random">随机</a></p>
<p><strong>提示：</strong>如果你希望改变你的评分，请先点击“X”取消你的评分，再重新评分。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00452/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&gt;&nbsp;图片文件</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">V&nbsp;文件名错误</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="https://i.postimg.cc/m2QkMpSk/zin.png" alt="zin.png" class="image" /></div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00452" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00452" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00452-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tomato-potato-mix" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4075168); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4075168&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606359665" alt="TOMATO-POTATO-MIX" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4075168)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tomato-potato-mix" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4075168); return false;">TOMATO-POTATO-MIX</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1603889376 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 Oct 2020 12:49</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00449/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一台基金会标准型号表演用机器人。当一名正常人类与项目接触超过5秒，项目会读取该人类的理想。读取完成后项目将迅速离开该人类，寻找大量人类聚集地并高声发出类似于日语“ゆめ(yume）～～ゆめ～～”的声音。任何听到项目发出声音的人类个体，其原有的理想都会被改写为项目此前所读取的理想。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-██<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>安置于Site-CN-██低价值异常物品储藏室。<br />
<strong>事件：</strong>20██/██/██，对项目进行例行实验过程中。在读取了D-374959的理想后由于安保人员疏忽大意，项目意外地离开了实验室。项目随后成功到达Site-CN-██食堂，其所发出的声响被正在就餐的上百名基金会员工耳闻。万幸的是，由于D-374959刚刚进行过月末洗脑，<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">是个没有梦想的孩子</span>不具有正常的思维，项目并未对听到声音的基金会员工造成太大影响。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>可恶，为什么我想吃屎？——正在就餐的██特工</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00449" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00449" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00449-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carter-lu" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6331978); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6331978&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606359665" alt="carter lu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6331978)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carter-lu" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6331978); return false;">carter lu</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1603203635 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">20 Oct 2020 14:20</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00409/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一只拳套，戴上后使用者只能使出<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/left-punch/">左勾拳</a>以对敌<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██市██仓库<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收藏在Site-CN-81低价值物品柜中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>这个东西除了能打出连续普通拳以外还有什么作用？——Dr.阙</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00409" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00409" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00409-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6441401&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606359665" alt="zeta-9-beta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6441401)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;">zeta-9-beta</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1601084223 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">26 Sep 2020 01:37</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00213/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一块黑板擦，任何被项目所接触的字迹都会变得无法被擦除<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>上海市███初级中学<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被放置于低价值异常物品收容室<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>这是和那块黑板配套的吗？</em>——特工fan</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00213" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00213" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00213-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606359665" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589957654 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">20 May 2020 06:54</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00269/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一面挂镜，当一名正常人类个体面对该镜子5秒以上时，此人在镜子中的映像突然消失<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site64的一间公共厕所中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>保存于Site64异常物品仓库<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><br />
“大晚上的路过镜子看不见人可真是恐怖”——初级研究员Ginger</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00269" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00269" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00269-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ginger249-jackie" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4136896); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4136896&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606359665" alt="Ginger249-Jackie" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4136896)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ginger249-jackie" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4136896); return false;">Ginger249-Jackie</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1592457134 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">18 Jun 2020 05:12</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00266/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一台[数据删除]牌空调，其正面设有一个温度调节器，可在-273℃和500℃间来回调整。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>███商场的██空调专卖店。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置在Dr.Yostem的办公室中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>好吧，我承认，这个空调确实很危险，但是是免费的啊！所以就放在我这吧，有时连电熨斗和电吹风都不用买了。</p>
<p>——Dr.Yostem</p>
